# V3 of docs/plan/release-0.6.0.md: SetDesktopSize of a VNC client changes
# the size of the host display. A screendump records each followed mode.
wait gpu_resize: session ready
vnc-size 1600 1000
wait gpu_resize: mode 1600x1000
screendump resize1.ppm
vnc-size 1280 720
wait gpu_resize: mode 1280x720
screendump resize2.ppm
wait gpu_resize: the mode no longer follows the window
vnc-size 1440 900
